# This file holds the pinned cosign public key used to verify
# blackglass .deb downloads during `curl | sh` install.
#
# Production: this file is regenerated by the release CI workflow,
# which uses cosign keyless OIDC signing tied to
#   https://github.com/blackglass/blackglass/.github/workflows/release.yml
# and pins the resulting certificate in this file.
#
# Local dev: generate a keypair with `cosign generate-key-pair`
# in this directory, then commit cosign.pub. The private key
# (cosign.key) is git-ignored.
#
# The install.sh script verifies each .deb blob with:
#   cosign verify-blob --signature *.deb.sig --certificate *.deb.cert \
#     --certificate-identity-regexp 'https://github.com/blackglass/blackglass/.*' \
#     --certificate-oidc-issuer 'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com' \
#     <deb>
#
# See ADR 0015 (deb-tiers-and-cosign-tofu.md) for the TOFU model.
